  "notes": [
    "¿A cómo están…? (\"at how much are…?\") is the market way to ask a price that changes by the day.",
    "¿Me hace una rebajita? (\"will you make me a little discount?\") is a polite, very Colombian way to bargain. The seller answers se lo dejo en… (\"I'll leave it to you at…\").",
    "Prices are in thousands of pesos: cuatro mil pesos, tres mil quinientos.",
    "Lulo is a sour Colombian fruit, mostly made into juice."
  ]
